{"id":"eabbec96eed6406c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFreeRow.md","title":"NFreeRow","display":"NFreeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NFreeRow","parameters":["z1498","z1499","z1500"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NFreeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1498</span><span>z1499</span><span>z1500</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>z1498</code>、<code>z1499</code>、<code>z1500</code>。</p>\n<p>自由名出现。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NFreeRow z1498 z1499 z1500)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists x\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair x t z1500)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat x)\n        (and\n          (@ NRaw t)\n          (or\n            (@ NVar x t)\n            (or\n              (exists z1503\n                (exists z1504\n                  (and\n                    (@ NLam z1503 z1504 t)\n                    (and\n                      (not (= x z1503))\n                      (exists z1506\n                        (exists z1507 (and (in z1506 z1499) (and (@ App z1498 z1506 z1507) (@ Pair x z1504 z1507)))))))))\n              (exists z1504\n                (exists z1505\n                  (and\n                    (@ NApp z1504 z1505 t)\n                    (or\n                      (exists z1508\n                        (exists z1509 (and (in z1508 z1499) (and (@ App z1498 z1508 z1509) (@ Pair x z1504 z1509)))))\n                      (exists z1510\n                        (exists z1511 (and (in z1510 z1499) (and (@ App z1498 z1510 z1511) (@ Pair x z1505 z1511))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cff538dd049d418\" href=\"?note=3cff538dd049d418\" title=\"ZFC_NApp\">NApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d7c6583016ee6af4\" href=\"?note=d7c6583016ee6af4\" title=\"ZFC_NLam\">NLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" href=\"?note=fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" title=\"ZFC_NVar\">NVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NFreeRow z1498 z1499 z1500)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_NApp|NApp]]；[[ZFC_NLam|NLam]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_NVar|NVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NApp","status